I doubt you will not get any artifact gifts at all if your guaranteed
gift is not available.* Wizmode testing is in order here. Certainly,
when no coaligned (not unaligned) artifacts that don't specifically
attack your current form can be gifted, you get locked out. But I have
on several occasions been granted an artifact while I was wearing a
helm of opposite alignment. The next gift after removing the helm was
the guaranteed "first" gift.

Once an artifact has been gifted, the unaligned once become available,
too.

* Case in point: knights do get artifacts from sacrifices, even though
their guaranteed first gift can never be granted: Excalibur.


